# Force LF everywhere, in the repo AND in the working copy.
#
# Without this, git on Windows checks files out with CRLF, so the data files
# would differ byte-for-byte between this machine and Colab. That breaks the
# reproducibility the split relies on and invites subtle parsing differences
# in files we read as strictly tab-separated. This repo syncs to Linux, so
# LF is the only sane choice.
* text=auto eol=lf
